  "prefLabel": "Odb 201.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-07-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 201.01 Purpose.\n\n(a) The purpose of this chapter is to provide uniform procedures for the conduct of all non-adjudicative and adjudicative proceedings, including requests for reconsideration, declaratory rulings, rulemaking petitions, and hearings in contested cases.\n\n(b) This chapter is intended to supplement the procedures established by RSA 541-A and any procedures or criteria established under any statute implemented by the oil fund disbursement board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Odb 200) #5534, eff 12-21-92; ss by #6543, eff 7-22-97, EXPIRED: 7-22-05\n\nNew. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
